  "description": "Life has been tough since Viola's Dad passed away 3 years ago. After days by days training, she embarks on a mission to explore ruins hoping for a fortune, together with two explorers she hired, Rain and Bleu. \n\nLittle does she know, that this expedition will cause her life to turn inside out. What she hopes for a fortune, goes into a curse instead. A strong curse which could turn her into a demon, a fairytale like in which people already think of as extinct.\n\n(Source: NamiComi)",
